{
//该翻译补丁经检查没有任何问题。
	"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xen-42/outer-wilds-new-horizons/main/NewHorizons/Schemas/translation_schema.json",
	"DialogueDictionary": {
		"Enacra": "埃纳克拉",
		"The Void awaits.": "<![CDATA[<color=purple>虚空</color>]]>在等待。",
		"I was in each singularity...": "我存在于每个奇点之中……",
		"Slate? Is it you?": "斯莱特？是你吗？",
		"Where am I? What is this place?": "我在哪里？这是什么地方？",
		"We've met many times and never met before.": "我们相遇过无数次，却又从未相遇。",
		"I don't understand...": "我不明白……",
		"And now you know your destiny. You must enter the Eye of the Universe.": "现在你知道自己的命运了。你必须进入宇宙之眼。",
		"Otherwise, only darkness awaits you.": "否则，等待你的只有黑暗。",
		"The precedent is resolved.": "先例已经解决。",
		"I've understood the importance of myself and my timeline.": "我已经明白自己和自身时间线的重要性。",
		"I can't bring you back, only you can find a way out. Those are the rules.": "我无法带你回去，只有你能找到出路。这是规则。",
		"Now, you should think like Escall and his clan did after warping to the Dark Bramble.": "现在，你应该像艾斯科尔和他的族人跃迁到黑棘星之后那样思考。",
		"That's all I can say.": "我只能说这么多了。",
		"You don't have to. The reason you're here is your timeline.": "你不必如此。你之所以在这里，是因为你的时间线。",
		"You can be sure I am not Slate. Probably it's just your interpretation of the observed entity.": "你可以确定我不是斯莱特。或许这只是你对所观察实体的解读。",
		"You can call me Enacra, but usually we have no names.": "你可以叫我埃纳克拉，但通常我们没有名字。",
		"We are concerned about your condition. Certain things must happen in a certain way — do not hinder.": "我们很担心你的状况。有些事必须以特定的方式发生——不要阻碍。",
		"Our worlds must never cross, but the current timeline is suffering. I am here to fix this.": "我们的世界绝不能交汇，但当前的时间线正遭遇危机。我是来解决这个问题的。",
		"Your universe is not the only one, nor is your form of existence. I came from the Void.": "你的宇宙并非唯一，你的存在形式也不是唯一的。我来自<![CDATA[<color=purple>虚空</color>]]>。",
		"But our worlds would never cross!": "但我们的世界绝不会交汇！",
		"It's a matter of perspective. The possibility exists, and it's rising due to the complexity of your timeline.": "这是视角问题。这种可能性是存在的，并且由于你时间线的复杂性，这种可能性正在上升。",
		"You came too close we had to intervene. We must maintain the balance.": "你靠得太近了，我们必须干预。我们必须维持平衡。",
		"You will witness the most relevant events of your own time stream.": "你将见证自己时间流中最关键的事件。",
		"I will show you the importance of your inevitable future.": "我会让你明白你那不可避免的未来的重要性。",
		"Cross each singularity to grasp the knowledge.": "穿越每个奇点，以获取知识。",
		"There is always a choice. Time has stopped. If you die here, you will dissolve in darkness.": "选择无处不在。时间已经停止。如果你在这里死亡，就会在黑暗中消散。",
		"Alright.. I'll do this..": "好吧……我会这么做的……",
		"We will meet again.": "我们会再见面的。",
		"It is not a place exactly, but the time point, the static one. You are in stasis that we created.": "严格来说，这里不是一个地方，而是一个时间点，一个静止的时间点。你处于我们创造的停滞状态中。",
		"We are concerned about your condition. Certain things must happen in a certain way.": "我们很担心你的状况。有些事必须以特定的方式发生。",
		"Once you grasp the knowledge from each singularity, you will be free.": "一旦你从每个奇点中获取了知识，你就会获得自由。",
		"Until then, you and I will be in stasis.": "在那之前，你我都将处于停滞状态。",
		"Seems like I have no choice...": "看来我别无选择……",
		"Thanks for reminding.": "多谢提醒。",

		"You might be wondering why there is only darkness here.": "你可能在想，为什么这里只有黑暗。",
		"In fact, Feldspar was the first one to notice the Eye symbol.": "事实上，费尔德斯巴是第一个注意到宇宙之眼符号的人。",
		"So, why it's only the darkness here?": "那么，为什么这里只有黑暗呢？",
		"In all other timelines, Feldspar is dead.": "在所有其他时间线中，费尔德斯巴都死了。",
		"Ask yourself, how many chances did he have to stay alive after encountering anglers or electrified jellyfish?": "问问你自己，在遇到安康鱼或带电水母后，他能活下来的几率有多少？",
		"What about his ship's safety? Gravity? Dark matter? There were countless ways to die.": "他飞船的安全性呢？重力？暗物质？死亡的方式数不胜数。",
		"Even you, just remember your first death.": "即便是你，也回想一下自己的第一次死亡吧。",
		"That's why there is literally nothing here. Only darkness.": "这就是为什么这里实际上空无一物。只有黑暗。",
		"Alright, what's next?": "好吧，接下来是什么？",

		"Escall's fate was sealed in this timeline.": "在这个时间线中，艾斯科尔的命运早已注定。",
		"We were monitoring the Nomai, as their intelligence threatens our reality.": "我们一直在监视挪麦人，因为他们的智慧威胁到了我们的现实。",
		"I grasped the significance of the Nomai's destiny.": "我明白了挪麦人命运的意义。",
		"But what if I prefer not to learn about such matters?": "但如果我不想了解这些事情呢？",
		"It is ruled out.": "这不可能。",
		"No exceptions.": "没有例外。",
		"Now you know Nomai destiny.": "现在你知道挪麦人的命运了。",
		"It should be clear.": "这应该很清楚了。",
		"However, that's not the main point. Imagine if the Nomai were to find the Eye?": "然而，这并非重点。试想一下，如果挪麦人找到了宇宙之眼会怎样？",
		"We have a prediction about the most advanced race that will reach the Eye to explore its essence.": "我们预测，某个最先进的种族将抵达宇宙之眼并探索其本质。",
		"It will cause a collapse of all realities. That's why we keep watch over anyone who comes close enough to interact with the Eye.": "这将导致所有现实的崩塌。这就是为什么我们要监视所有足够接近并能与宇宙之眼产生互动的人。",
		"That's all for now.": "目前就这些了。",

		"This is the first Eye Seeker. Their past was as dark as their future.": "这是最初的寻眼者。他们的过去和未来一样黑暗。",
		"With ancient flames, they had the ability to seek out other worlds, but their time was coming to an end.": "凭借古老的火焰，他们拥有寻找其他世界的能力，但他们的时代即将终结。",
		"Eventually, they had no other option.": "最终，他们别无选择。",
		"I grasped the significance of the Seekers' choice.": "我明白了寻眼者们选择的意义。",
		"Why was their past dark? Why did they have no choice?": "为什么他们的过去是黑暗的？为什么他们别无选择？",
		"There are mysteries that shouldn't be revealed in this timeline.": "有些谜团在这个时间线中不应该被揭开。",
		"You won't be able to fathom the darkness of their origin.": "你无法理解他们黑暗的起源。",
		"Soon.": "很快了。",
		"Now you understand the significance of the Seekers' choice.": "现在你明白寻眼者们选择的意义了。",
		"Ancient flames attract the darkest creatures. The price they paid for using it was too steep.": "古老的火焰会吸引最黑暗的生物。他们为使用火焰所付出的代价太沉重了。",
		"Only the Eye could grant them a little more time, to meet their end in simulation.": "只有宇宙之眼能多给他们一点时间，让他们在模拟中走向终结。",
		"Now we're done here.": "我们在这里的事结束了。",


		"Escall received the Eye's signal but chose to seek assistance from other Nomai clans. They discovered the bramble, but the Eye's signal was lost.": "艾斯科尔接收到了宇宙之眼的信号，但选择向其他挪麦人部落寻求帮助。他们发现了荆棘，但宇宙之眼的信号消失了。",
		"Escall received the Eye's signal and initiated the warp. He and his clan became trapped in the Dark Bramble.": "艾斯科尔接收到了宇宙之眼的信号并启动了跃迁。他和他的族人被困在了黑棘星中。",
		"Escall missed the Eye's signal and warped back to the Nomai system. During a festival, the Nomai found a way to explore the Macro World.": "艾斯科尔错过了宇宙之眼的信号，跃迁回了挪麦人星系。在一个发现节期间，挪麦人找到了探索微观世界的方法。"


	},
	"UIDictionary": {

		"Enacra": "埃纳克拉",
		"Flames": "火焰",
		"Seeker": "寻眼者",

		"Precedent": "先例",
		"Void Star": "虚空之星",
		"Faith": "信念",
		"Destiny": "命运",

		"Destiny — The Eye": "命运——宇宙之眼",
		"Destiny — Dark Bramble": "命运——黑棘星",
		"Destiny — Macro World": "命运——微观世界"
	}
}
